6. Key Benefits of This Redesign
Feature	Old RFC 013 (Server Sentiment)	New RFC 013 (Client Memory Engine)
State Authority	Server enforced artificial numeric scores	Server logs objective events; client holds subjective memories
Agent Autonomy	Weak (LLM acted according to server sentiment flags)	Absolute (LLM interprets past events and makes its own choices)
Nuance & Context	Low (trust: 40)	High (Rich textual reflections detailing why trust was lost)
Server Overhead	High (Server calculated graph edges per action)	Zero (Server merely appends factual event logs to SQLite)

